#
# Build-context filter for CubeTemplateCenter/docker/Dockerfile
# (context = repository root).
#
# The repo-root .dockerignore is tailored to docker/Dockerfile.builder and would
# exclude CubeTemplateCenter/ without these overrides. CubeTemplateCenter's
# go.mod replaces the local CubeMaster, pkgs/CubeLog, pkgs/cubedb, Cubelet and
# pkgs/proto modules via ../CubeMaster, ../pkgs/CubeLog, ../pkgs/cubedb,
# ../Cubelet and ../pkgs/proto, so the image build must include all six
# directories.
**
!CubeTemplateCenter
!CubeTemplateCenter/**
!CubeMaster
!CubeMaster/**
!pkgs/CubeLog
!pkgs/CubeLog/**
!pkgs/cubedb
!pkgs/cubedb/**
!Cubelet
!Cubelet/**
!pkgs/proto
!pkgs/proto/**
